// BT-3947 (closes BT-3948): runs the cells of
// fixtures/bt3947inline_block_loop_{actor,class,value}.bt; the expected
// values are the class-method answers. Each cell was a compile error in an
// actor method under BT-3948's `InlineBlockLocalInLoop` row.

